{"id":"wb-6-263","name":"许慎墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"许慎墓","text":"许慎墓位于河南省漯河市召陵区姬石乡许庄村东土岗上。为东汉时期著名经学家、文字学家许慎之墓。东南3公里为汉召陵故城，西1公里为沙河。墓冢高5米，周长33米，墓前立有清顺治十三年（1656年）郾城县知县荆其惇重修墓碑、康熙四十六年（1707年）知县温德裕立《汉孝廉许公之墓》碑和光绪二年（1876年）知县王凤森撰文并立《许夫子从祀文庙记碑》。其子许冲墓在许庄村西北。该村北原有许慎故祠，已废。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%AE%B8%E6%85%8E%E5%A2%93","revisionId":92236049,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92236049","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7bffef161c7a121e99f9d369.jpg","title":"20240818_Tomb_of_Xu_Shen_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240818_Tomb_of_Xu_Shen_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/20240818_Tomb_of_Xu_Shen_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​漯河召陵许慎墓","width":320,"height":213}}